WEBVTT

00:00:14.770 --> 00:00:16.700
The Artista Selection Exam?

00:00:16.700 --> 00:00:19.450
<b>23 Days</b>

00:00:17.240 --> 00:00:19.450
It's an exam taken by third years.

00:00:19.470 --> 00:00:33.360
<b>23 days until the summer festival!</b>

00:00:19.870 --> 00:00:22.500
It's so intense, every year 
a few students end up

00:00:22.500 --> 00:00:24.530
repeating the year or dropping out.

00:00:24.530 --> 00:00:26.330
That happens?

00:00:26.330 --> 00:00:29.110
It's no surprise you know so much, 
considering you've taken it before.

00:00:29.110 --> 00:00:30.640
Well, yeah.

00:00:30.640 --> 00:00:32.880
That's nothing to brag about.

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:36.980
Will Tatewaki-senpai be all right?

00:00:36.980 --> 00:00:38.350
He'll be fine.

00:00:38.850 --> 00:00:41.200
In the month since he joined the committee,

00:00:41.200 --> 00:00:45.100
he completed the arch we'll 
display at the entrance.

00:00:45.760 --> 00:00:47.300
He's an exceptional person.

00:00:47.300 --> 00:00:49.860
He'll easily pass the exam.

00:00:49.860 --> 00:00:51.540
You're right.

00:00:52.480 --> 00:00:55.030
I want to eat Rin Rin's sweets now.

00:00:55.030 --> 00:00:58.720
Macarons, shortcake, grape tarts.

00:00:58.720 --> 00:01:01.800
Senpai, start working already.

00:01:01.800 --> 00:01:06.050
What? Kanato, how do you 
always have so much energy?

00:01:06.620 --> 00:01:08.910
Because I'm young, I guess.

00:01:13.800 --> 00:01:15.260
It's not bad.

00:01:15.490 --> 00:01:18.150
He's used the materials properly.

00:01:18.150 --> 00:01:19.650
Pass.

00:01:19.650 --> 00:01:21.210
Thank you.

00:01:25.310 --> 00:01:27.440
Next, Tatewaki Rintaro.

00:01:27.440 --> 00:01:28.650
Yes, sir.

00:01:36.350 --> 00:01:37.920
Wow!

00:01:37.920 --> 00:01:38.880
It's huge.

00:01:38.880 --> 00:01:40.660
Way to go, Tatewaki.

00:01:42.910 --> 00:01:45.300
The workmanship is good.

00:01:45.850 --> 00:01:47.000
But...

00:01:47.810 --> 00:01:50.080
The work is too stiff.

00:01:51.680 --> 00:01:54.590
This isn't professional quality work.

00:01:55.060 --> 00:01:59.930
The biggest problem is that he hasn't 
expressed himself in the work.

00:02:04.480 --> 00:02:05.470
Fail.

00:02:06.960 --> 00:02:09.980
That concludes today's 
Artista Selection Exam.

00:02:10.320 --> 00:02:13.340
Those of you who failed today will 
take the exam again in one week.

00:02:13.340 --> 00:02:15.720
Make sure you finish your 
assignments by then.

00:02:30.540 --> 00:02:37.160
<b>Magic-Kyun Renaissance</b>

00:03:47.990 --> 00:03:52.000
Shining Like the Sun

00:03:58.460 --> 00:03:59.380
All right.

00:04:01.130 --> 00:04:03.140
This is delicious, Senpai.

00:04:03.140 --> 00:04:04.080
Thanks.

00:04:04.500 --> 00:04:07.060
Nothing makes me happier 
than hearing you say that.

00:04:07.060 --> 00:04:08.600
They're all so delicious.

00:04:08.600 --> 00:04:10.320
Thanks. Eat up!

00:04:10.320 --> 00:04:13.300
I can't stop eating them.

00:04:13.300 --> 00:04:14.790
There's no need to hold back.

00:04:14.790 --> 00:04:16.260
Eat all you want.

00:04:16.260 --> 00:04:20.140
So, how did your Artista Exam go?

00:04:23.940 --> 00:04:25.910
Sorry, guys. I failed.

00:04:27.200 --> 00:04:29.160
I'm taking the makeup exam.

00:04:29.500 --> 00:04:31.870
If I fail that too, I'll be dropping out.

00:04:31.870 --> 00:04:32.910
Dropping out?

00:04:33.540 --> 00:04:34.550
Guys...

00:04:35.140 --> 00:04:35.920
I'm sorry!

00:04:36.250 --> 00:04:38.720
I want to focus on sculpting.

00:04:38.720 --> 00:04:41.420
Please let me take a break 
from the committee for a week.

00:04:45.340 --> 00:04:50.790
The Hoshi Festival committee has made 
huge bounds forward thanks to you.

00:04:51.530 --> 00:04:53.620
Please come back soon.

00:04:53.620 --> 00:04:56.190
We need your strength.

00:04:56.440 --> 00:04:57.940
Ichijoji...

00:04:58.720 --> 00:05:01.030
Don't worry about us while you're gone.

00:05:01.030 --> 00:05:02.040
Good luck.

00:05:02.670 --> 00:05:04.070
Senpai, fight!

00:05:04.620 --> 00:05:06.600
Leave it to us.

00:05:06.600 --> 00:05:08.740
Finish as quick as you can.

00:05:08.740 --> 00:05:09.950
We'll be waiting for you.

00:05:11.170 --> 00:05:12.470
Thanks.

00:05:12.980 --> 00:05:16.180
I want to make the Hoshi Festival 
a success with you guys.

00:05:16.780 --> 00:05:18.960
I promise I'll be back.

00:05:40.180 --> 00:05:41.480
It's delicious!

00:05:41.780 --> 00:05:44.010
There's nothing like homemade food.

00:05:44.010 --> 00:05:47.620
That's good. I wasn't sure what you liked.

00:05:47.620 --> 00:05:50.240
I love salted salmon and mustard greens.

00:05:50.820 --> 00:05:51.990
Have some of this, too.

00:05:51.990 --> 00:05:55.150
Thank you. You couldn't have done a better job.

00:05:55.150 --> 00:05:56.340
It was nothing.

00:05:59.200 --> 00:06:02.120
Everyone should have a kind junior like you.

00:06:03.210 --> 00:06:05.760
All Monet ever does is eat.

00:06:05.980 --> 00:06:10.770
He's a really picky eater, 
so just feeding him is a chore.

00:06:11.810 --> 00:06:15.350
He's waiting for you to come back, too.

00:06:18.500 --> 00:06:20.260
Is it a bird?

00:06:20.260 --> 00:06:22.650
Yeah, an owl.

00:06:22.940 --> 00:06:24.670
I had a lot of trouble deciding.

00:06:24.670 --> 00:06:25.970
Are these your sketches?

00:06:25.970 --> 00:06:26.900
Yeah.

00:06:29.700 --> 00:06:31.260
It's so cool.

00:06:31.260 --> 00:06:32.280
Isn't it?

00:06:32.930 --> 00:06:34.840
But why an owl?

00:06:34.840 --> 00:06:37.170
Do you know about the owl on the clock tower?

00:06:37.170 --> 00:06:38.790
Oh, yeah.

00:06:39.110 --> 00:06:41.530
My grandpa made that.

00:06:41.530 --> 00:06:42.170
What?

00:06:42.580 --> 00:06:45.550
Your grandfather is a sculptor, too?

00:06:45.970 --> 00:06:52.150
Yeah. That owl is the reason 
I started sculpting.

00:06:55.070 --> 00:06:56.560
It's incredible.

00:06:58.190 --> 00:06:59.990
Fantastic.

00:07:19.490 --> 00:07:20.210
Grandpa.

00:07:21.770 --> 00:07:24.630
I'm going to be like you.

00:07:24.630 --> 00:07:27.960
I'm going be a cool sculptor like you.

00:07:28.550 --> 00:07:32.220
Really? I look forward to that.

00:07:32.450 --> 00:07:33.410
Yeah.

00:07:35.960 --> 00:07:41.880
So I decided to return to my 
roots and try making an owl.

00:07:42.880 --> 00:07:47.180
Senpai, I'm sure you'll be all right.

00:07:47.180 --> 00:07:48.980
I'm really excited to see it.

00:07:49.280 --> 00:07:51.740
Sure thing. Thanks.

00:07:52.460 --> 00:07:55.740
Georgie, we're still working?

00:07:55.740 --> 00:08:06.250
<b>22 days until the Summer Festival</b>

00:07:56.050 --> 00:07:57.590
Of course.

00:07:57.590 --> 00:07:59.240
If we don't finish this today,

00:07:59.240 --> 00:08:01.370
we'll fall behind schedule.

00:08:01.370 --> 00:08:02.740
I'm tired.

00:08:02.740 --> 00:08:06.250
We're already behind schedule.

00:08:06.510 --> 00:08:10.340
Isn't that part of life?

00:08:10.340 --> 00:08:13.290
You can say that after you've made 
an effort to keep to the schedule.

00:08:13.290 --> 00:08:14.260
You're so strict.

00:08:14.260 --> 00:08:18.210
Why do I have to count the inventory?

00:08:18.210 --> 00:08:19.740
It doesn't make sense. Right, Rin?

00:08:20.250 --> 00:08:22.820
Tsukushi, move your hands, not your mouth.

00:08:27.440 --> 00:08:30.880
There's no way we'll finish this today.

00:08:30.880 --> 00:08:33.600
Even if we don't do it now, 
we'll have to do it eventually.

00:08:33.600 --> 00:08:35.280
When's that?

00:08:37.400 --> 00:08:39.790
If only Rin Rin were here.

00:08:40.320 --> 00:08:43.290
<i>Let's eat this and give it one last push!</i>

00:08:44.740 --> 00:08:46.360
<i>Let's do it!</i>

00:08:47.120 --> 00:08:48.690
He'd do that for us.

00:08:53.300 --> 00:08:56.000
I can't do it anymore.

00:08:56.000 --> 00:08:58.560
I'm hungry.

00:08:58.560 --> 00:09:00.270
I'm at my limit.

00:09:00.270 --> 00:09:04.430
The tape rolls are starting 
to look like baumkuchens.

00:09:04.730 --> 00:09:09.800
Georgie, chairman, you're still going 
to make us keep working?

00:09:10.400 --> 00:09:12.610
I guess we can take a break.

00:09:12.610 --> 00:09:14.020
All right!

00:09:14.020 --> 00:09:15.920
I'll go to the store.

00:09:15.920 --> 00:09:17.380
Guys.

00:09:22.370 --> 00:09:23.930
I feel revitalized.

00:09:23.930 --> 00:09:25.520
Thanks.

00:09:25.520 --> 00:09:28.530
We were just thinking about taking a break.

00:09:28.530 --> 00:09:31.400
I just happened to have good timing.

00:09:31.400 --> 00:09:33.080
You're awfully considerate, aren't you?

00:09:33.080 --> 00:09:35.880
Are you psychic?

00:09:36.720 --> 00:09:37.760
Actually...

00:09:40.880 --> 00:09:42.430
Oh, right. Aigasaki.

00:09:42.430 --> 00:09:43.060
Yes?

00:09:43.060 --> 00:09:46.440
Could you take some sweets 
to the committee for me?

00:09:47.460 --> 00:09:49.700
Sweets?

00:09:49.700 --> 00:09:52.400
Don't you feel re-energized 
after eating sweets?

00:09:52.400 --> 00:09:52.940
Oh, right.

00:09:53.400 --> 00:09:55.550
I wish I could go,

00:09:55.550 --> 00:09:58.110
but they'd probably just worry about me.

00:09:58.680 --> 00:10:00.320
Tatewaki-senpai.

00:10:00.320 --> 00:10:01.900
Thank you.

00:10:02.840 --> 00:10:04.370
He never changes.

00:10:05.920 --> 00:10:08.750
He should be focusing on himself right now.

00:10:09.380 --> 00:10:11.800
He doesn't show it,

00:10:11.800 --> 00:10:14.510
but he's been worried for a while.

00:10:15.100 --> 00:10:16.340
About his grades?

00:10:16.340 --> 00:10:17.410
Yeah.

00:10:17.410 --> 00:10:20.010
So that's why he wouldn't join the committee.

00:10:20.260 --> 00:10:22.760
He was working so hard, though.

00:10:24.210 --> 00:10:26.270
We don't need to worry about him.

00:10:26.500 --> 00:10:30.820
I know he'll meet our expectations.

00:10:31.600 --> 00:10:35.030
Your hard work will never let you down.

00:10:42.950 --> 00:10:45.120
I'm really excited to see it.

00:10:47.410 --> 00:10:50.000
This isn't professional quality work.

00:10:50.000 --> 00:10:50.890
Ow!

00:11:40.190 --> 00:11:41.470
Senpai.

00:11:41.860 --> 00:11:43.220
Aigasaki?

00:11:44.950 --> 00:11:46.370
For you.

00:11:46.370 --> 00:11:47.280
Magic.

00:11:47.280 --> 00:11:48.520
Kyun.

00:11:49.850 --> 00:11:50.640
Magic.

00:11:50.640 --> 00:11:51.570
Kyun.

00:11:51.570 --> 00:11:53.980
Renaissance.

00:11:57.330 --> 00:11:59.500
What a nice view!

00:12:00.270 --> 00:12:00.990
Whoops.

00:12:01.430 --> 00:12:03.360
It's dangerous up here. Be careful.

00:12:03.360 --> 00:12:04.810
Sorry.

00:12:06.210 --> 00:12:07.810
Thanks.

00:12:07.810 --> 00:12:08.990
It's fine.

00:12:09.440 --> 00:12:11.870
Anyway, I'm surprised you knew I was here.

00:12:12.130 --> 00:12:14.960
You said your grandfather's 
sculpture was here,

00:12:14.960 --> 00:12:16.000
so I thought you might be.

00:12:16.210 --> 00:12:17.170
I see.

00:12:17.680 --> 00:12:19.870
Do you come here often?

00:12:19.870 --> 00:12:23.760
Yeah. It helps me relax.

00:12:26.100 --> 00:12:28.130
It's a nice place.

00:12:28.130 --> 00:12:29.010
Yeah.

00:12:54.700 --> 00:12:57.380
I'm grateful to you guys.

00:12:57.380 --> 00:12:58.000
What?

00:12:58.370 --> 00:13:01.510
My hands were so full with my own stuff,

00:13:02.520 --> 00:13:04.960
I couldn't join the committee.

00:13:04.960 --> 00:13:09.220
But you accepted me so easily.

00:13:09.540 --> 00:13:10.480
It made me happy.

00:13:10.970 --> 00:13:15.700
So, I really want to respond 
to those feelings.

00:13:16.650 --> 00:13:19.360
I have to give it everything I've got.

00:13:19.360 --> 00:13:20.700
Senpai.

00:13:21.120 --> 00:13:22.340
Just kidding.

00:13:26.440 --> 00:13:29.480
Break time is over.

00:13:29.480 --> 00:13:32.370
Thanks for the rice balls. 
I'll eat them later.

00:13:32.660 --> 00:13:33.200
Okay.

00:13:33.200 --> 00:13:35.210
Oh, right.

00:13:36.540 --> 00:13:38.710
Do you have a minute?

00:13:44.900 --> 00:13:45.720
Done.

00:13:47.490 --> 00:13:48.840
This is for you.

00:13:50.830 --> 00:13:51.810
Are you sure?

00:13:51.810 --> 00:13:52.720
Of course.

00:13:53.120 --> 00:13:54.960
Thank you.

00:13:55.770 --> 00:13:57.980
It's so cute.

00:13:59.560 --> 00:14:01.660
It's nothing special.

00:14:03.110 --> 00:14:06.240
I'm so happy you gave this to me. Thank you.

00:14:07.670 --> 00:14:10.740
It's amazing how you made this so quickly.

00:14:11.080 --> 00:14:12.770
It's so cute.

00:14:25.730 --> 00:14:27.220
That's it.

00:14:29.420 --> 00:14:31.580
Thank you, Aigasaki.

00:14:31.580 --> 00:14:32.300
Huh?

00:14:32.990 --> 00:14:34.310
I think I understand now.

00:14:35.420 --> 00:14:36.570
Senpai!

00:14:37.720 --> 00:14:39.940
I'm know you'll be all right.

00:14:41.200 --> 00:14:42.270
Thanks.

00:14:49.730 --> 00:14:50.820
<i>I had forgotten.</i>

00:14:52.690 --> 00:14:55.580
<i>I started sculpting because</i>

00:14:57.160 --> 00:14:59.040
<i>I wanted to see people smile.</i>

00:15:01.090 --> 00:15:05.670
<i>But I was terrified of dropping out.</i>

00:15:09.620 --> 00:15:14.050
<i>I want to make everyone smile with my works.</i>

00:15:16.620 --> 00:15:19.060
<i>And now I have to show them that feeling.</i>

00:15:31.980 --> 00:15:32.820
All right.

00:15:33.550 --> 00:15:35.700
One more push.

00:16:01.570 --> 00:16:02.890
It's done.

00:16:08.640 --> 00:16:10.540
It's nearly time.

00:16:10.540 --> 00:16:11.360
Yeah.

00:16:11.360 --> 00:16:13.610
Rin Rin's Makeup Exam

00:16:11.360 --> 00:16:13.610
Fight!

00:16:11.360 --> 00:16:13.610
You can do it

00:16:12.110 --> 00:16:13.610
He'll be fine.

00:16:13.970 --> 00:16:15.960
I believe in him, too.

00:16:30.150 --> 00:16:30.840
Pass.

00:16:32.690 --> 00:16:33.970
Thank you!

00:16:34.480 --> 00:16:36.690
Next, Tatewaki Rintaro.

00:16:36.690 --> 00:16:37.390
Yes, sir.

00:16:37.390 --> 00:16:38.970
Thank you for reviewing my work.

00:16:47.860 --> 00:16:48.720
What?

00:16:48.720 --> 00:16:49.190
What is this?

00:16:49.190 --> 00:16:50.090
No way.

00:16:50.090 --> 00:16:51.160
Why?

00:16:50.480 --> 00:16:55.490
Recommendation

00:16:51.160 --> 00:16:52.680
What?

00:16:53.810 --> 00:16:55.490
He's dropping out, huh?

00:16:56.580 --> 00:16:58.600
We didn't know each other long,

00:16:58.600 --> 00:17:00.490
but thanks for all your help.

00:17:02.300 --> 00:17:05.500
Sorry I couldn't come back.

00:17:06.080 --> 00:17:07.750
No...

00:17:08.190 --> 00:17:09.920
This doesn't make sense!

00:17:10.590 --> 00:17:12.210
You should try again!

00:17:12.580 --> 00:17:14.900
You've worked so hard.

00:17:15.680 --> 00:17:17.220
I can't believe this is the result.

00:17:19.190 --> 00:17:20.310
Thanks.

00:17:21.050 --> 00:17:23.810
But I gave everything I had until the end.

00:17:24.540 --> 00:17:28.060
I guess that's why I feel fine about it.

00:17:28.290 --> 00:17:29.590
Senpai.

00:17:31.620 --> 00:17:33.590
I'm really sorry.

00:17:35.330 --> 00:17:39.000
Anyway, I want to thank you guys.

00:17:42.280 --> 00:17:44.330
Have a taste of my feelings.

00:17:45.330 --> 00:17:47.060
We can't eat that.

00:17:47.060 --> 00:17:50.340
Don't be that way. It's good.

00:17:50.340 --> 00:17:52.710
I want to see you guys smile.

00:17:54.670 --> 00:17:55.720
Shall we eat?

00:17:56.410 --> 00:17:58.020
Kanato, come on.

00:18:00.480 --> 00:18:01.540
Okay.

00:18:01.540 --> 00:18:02.970
Come on, everyone.

00:18:05.530 --> 00:18:06.980
Come on, Tsuku Tsuku.

00:18:09.730 --> 00:18:11.980
You're the only one who's fine with this.

00:18:14.360 --> 00:18:16.860
Thanks, guys.

00:18:20.600 --> 00:18:28.690
<i>I've been searching and chasing 
beyond my dreams sweets a la mode</i>

00:18:28.220 --> 00:18:29.620
Are these...

00:18:28.690 --> 00:18:35.080
<i>They're packed full of smiles</i>

00:18:37.950 --> 00:18:41.050
Senpai, the sparkles...

00:18:41.050 --> 00:18:43.010
I can see your sparkles!

00:18:52.290 --> 00:18:55.440
<i>It's probably inevitable</i>

00:18:55.440 --> 00:18:57.660
<i>Because I wanted</i>

00:18:57.660 --> 00:19:01.300
<i>To see someone smile</i>

00:19:01.300 --> 00:19:04.860
<i>I came this far</i>

00:19:04.860 --> 00:19:07.990
<i>There's more than one way</i>

00:19:07.990 --> 00:19:11.850
<i>The most important thing</i>

00:19:11.850 --> 00:19:17.380
<i>Is to put your heart into it</i>

00:19:17.650 --> 00:19:21.540
<i>It took me a while</i>

00:19:21.540 --> 00:19:24.260
<i>To realize what it was</i>

00:19:24.260 --> 00:19:27.520
<i>But I always had</i>

00:19:27.520 --> 00:19:31.100
<i>A grasp of my abilities</i>

00:19:31.100 --> 00:19:33.700
<i>I found my answer</i>

00:19:33.700 --> 00:19:41.610
<i>I pour all the smiles I 
have into sweets a la mode</i>

00:19:41.610 --> 00:19:46.450
<i>So everyone will smile once they taste them</i>

00:19:46.450 --> 00:19:49.290
<i>If you'll accept my gift</i>

00:19:49.290 --> 00:19:52.620
<i>If you'll smile</i>

00:19:52.620 --> 00:19:56.380
<i>That's enough to satisfy me</i>

00:19:56.380 --> 00:20:01.400
<i>I hope my delightful confections reach you</i>

00:20:03.860 --> 00:20:04.840
Tatewaki-kun.

00:20:05.220 --> 00:20:06.020
Yes, sir.

00:20:07.060 --> 00:20:08.280
This is incredible.

00:20:09.810 --> 00:20:12.600
This is your magical art.

00:20:13.990 --> 00:20:15.100
You pass.

00:20:17.030 --> 00:20:20.110
I hope you'll become an Artista 
of confectionery making.

00:20:20.530 --> 00:20:21.980
All right!

00:20:21.980 --> 00:20:23.930
You did it, Senpai!

00:20:24.610 --> 00:20:27.120
Pass.

00:20:27.490 --> 00:20:30.180
You did it. Great.

00:20:31.430 --> 00:20:33.230
Thanks, Aigasaki.

00:20:33.230 --> 00:20:34.000
What?

00:20:34.880 --> 00:20:37.000
You helped me realize that

00:20:37.410 --> 00:20:40.760
what I wanted to do was make people smile.

00:20:41.100 --> 00:20:42.490
Senpai.

00:20:45.620 --> 00:20:49.500
All right. It's time to make the 
whole world smile with sweets.

00:20:49.500 --> 00:20:50.640
The world?

00:20:50.640 --> 00:20:53.410
The scale you're pursuing is as huge as ever.

00:20:53.410 --> 00:20:56.010
That's who you're meant to be, Rin Rin.

00:20:56.010 --> 00:20:57.020
Let's work together.

00:20:57.300 --> 00:21:00.040
Senpai, congratulations.

00:21:00.040 --> 00:21:02.280
We're really happy for you.

00:21:02.280 --> 00:21:04.880
Sorry for making you guys worry.

00:21:04.880 --> 00:21:06.270
I'll do my best from now on.

00:21:06.270 --> 00:21:07.780
Rintaro.

00:21:08.200 --> 00:21:12.010
I'm glad you're back.

00:21:12.920 --> 00:21:15.040
Yeah. Me too.

00:21:19.380 --> 00:21:21.170
<b>Welcome Back ,Rintaro</b>

00:21:25.710 --> 00:21:29.680
I know a lot has happened, 
but we're all here now.

00:21:30.420 --> 00:21:32.020
We don't have much time,

00:21:32.020 --> 00:21:36.100
but let's do our best to prepare for 
the Hoshi Festival and Art Session.

00:21:36.100 --> 00:21:40.190
Yeah. I know we can put on 
the greatest Art Session.

00:21:40.190 --> 00:21:42.420
I know we can do it.

00:21:42.420 --> 00:21:45.070
With our hearts as one.

00:21:45.070 --> 00:21:47.950
All right! To the Hoshi Festival!

00:21:47.950 --> 00:21:49.820
Yeah!

00:23:25.860 --> 00:23:29.420
Why do you stir up my heart the way you do?

00:23:29.420 --> 00:23:30.760
If I hadn't met you,

00:23:31.110 --> 00:23:33.050
I wouldn't have had to change.

00:23:33.310 --> 00:23:37.180
Next time on Magic-Kyun! Renaissance: 
"The Light Out of Reach."

00:23:34.760 --> 00:23:39.930
<b>The Light Out of Reach</b>

00:23:37.180 --> 00:23:38.720
Magic-Kyun for you.

00:23:38.720 --> 00:23:39.920
Forget I said that.
